        "content": "<p>CHAPTER I. CHAPTER II. CHAPTER III. CHAPTER IV. CHAPTER V. CHAPTER VI. CHAPTER VII. CHAPTER VIII. CHAPTER IX. CHAPTER X. CHAPTER XI. CHAPTER XII. CHAPTER XIII. CHAPTER XIV.</p><p>ILLUSTRATIONS</p><p>\"The Clergyman and Christie.\"</p><p>\"Christie and Master Treffy\"</p><p>\"Home, Sweet Home\"</p><p>CHRISTIE'S OLD ORGAN;</p><p>\"HOME, SWEET HOME.\"</p>",
