        "title": "Chapter V",
        "content": "<p>CHAPTER V.</p><p>The Struggle between an alleged Jus Divinum Regum , and Popular Sovereignty.—And the Efforts now attempted to destroy our Grand Experiment of Self-Government.—Practical Results. ... 104</p><p>MYSTICISM, AND ITS RESULTS.</p>",
