        "content": "<p>A. Nine hundred and fifty years. Gen. 9:29. [§ II. ¶ 45.]</p><p>Q. What was Shem's age when Arphaxad was born?</p><p>A. One hundred years. Gen. 11:10.</p><p>Q. What was Arphaxad's age when Salah was born! Thirty five years. Gen. 11:12.</p><p>Q. What was Salah's age when Eber was born?</p><p>A. Thirty years. Gen. 11:16.</p><p>Q. What was Eber's age when Peleg was born?</p><p>A. Thirty four years. Gen. 11:14.</p><p>Q. What was Peleg's age when Reu was born?</p><p>A. Thirty years. Gen. 11:18.</p><p>Q. What was Reu's age when Serug was born?</p><p>A. Thirty two years. Gen. 11:20.</p><p>Q. What was Serug's age when Nahor was born?</p><p>A. Thirty years. Gen. 11:22.</p><p>Q. What was Nahor's age when Terah was born?</p><p>A. Twenty nine years. Gen. 11:24.</p><p>Q. What was Terah's age when Nahor (the brother of Abraham) was born?</p><p>A. Seventy years. Gen. 11:26.</p><p>Q. What was Terah's age when Abraham was born?</p>",
