    "title": "A record of St. Cybi's Church, Holyhead : and the sermon preached after its restoration, 1879",
    "description": "The public-domain text of A record of St. Cybi's Church, Holyhead : and the sermon preached after its restoration, 1879 by Arthur Penrhyn Stanley, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 1,
    "tags": [
      "knowledge",
      "wisdom",
