    "title": "Sovereign Grace: Its Source, Its Nature and Its Effects",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Sovereign Grace: Its Source, Its Nature and Its Effects by Dwight Lyman Moody, preserved across 8 original sections with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 8,
    "tags": [
      "knowledge",
      "wisdom",
