        "content": "<p>A thousand vintages to-day,</p><p>The dear Redeemer’s blood display,</p><p>From Samos’ isle of ruddy vines,</p><p>To where the Finland chalice shines;</p><p>And where the Hindu hand hath crush’d</p><p>The grape that in the jungle blush’d;</p><p>Or where the Huron’s cluster wild,</p><p>Is on the altar, undefiled.</p><p>And grain that hath to harvest grown,</p><p>Upon a thousand mountains sown,</p><p>From green Arkansas, to Cathay,</p><p>Is bless’d for Jesu’s flesh to-day.</p>",
